{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bridges together, cross them, and reach Treasure Island! The materials for the bridge can be anything: wood, desks, even pianos! Throw and stick them together to build your bridge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Throw and Stick to Build!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to Treasure Island is treacherous. It\u2019s full of holes and has no roads. Chop wood or break boxes to find wooden planks, furniture, and more. Throw them and stick them together to create a bridge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dangerous Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enormous snowballs and giant exploding flowers! Nature is baring its fangs to return you to the earth. Deal with them carefully but speedily. Why speedily...? See below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Approaching Storm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There\u2019s no time to dawdle. If the storm chasing you touches you, it\u2019s instant death! Cooperation is essential to build bridges quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Play</strong> Build bridges with up to 8 players! Of course, you can play solo too. Go get that treasure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5\u3010Regarding Videos and Streaming\u3011</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and gameplay videos are welcome. Please check the following two points:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the game's title in your video title. (Required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the Steam store page URL in the description. (Optional)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969510?t=1774286922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969510?t=1774286922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969510/dcc0b5a7a4277cde46361814df1fa7472a75a287/capsule_231x87.jpg